ocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n \n \n 最近みかんがあるとすぐ冷凍庫に入れて\n 冷凍みかんにして食べてます！\n \n \n シャーベットみたいで美味しい⠒̫⃝\n \n \n くみたんも冷凍みかん好きだそうです！\n この前一緒に食べました♡\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X668VF40HW4FGSZ88DB8Z","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X676PVTJBDDK4VCV998ZN","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n めいのみかんも剥いてー！\n って言ったら剥いてくれたんですが、、\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X684B1G60M70YSXKY8NG2","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n  \n \n みかんの皮を私の携帯の画面の上に\n 載せてくる くみたんでした(。-_-。)笑\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0X692WNY5TMM201EP96W1Q","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n おわり\n \n \n \n \n \n ブログご覧になって下さってありがとうございます\n \n \n ❤︎ ひがしむら めい ˙˚ ᕱ⑅ᕱ ˚˙ ❤︎"}],"source":"archive"},"ofc-n46-57381":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柴田柚菜です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/08/12/1839543/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近すっごく暑いですよね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"体調は大丈夫ですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお水飲もう( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一昨日はCDTVライブ！ライブ！に出演させていただきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"未だに信じられません。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私、歌番組に出演させていただいたのですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しかも生放送です"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に感謝してもしきれません"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もし乃木坂46に加入してなかったらテレビに張り付いてリアルタイムで番組を観ていたと思います笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"I see...という楽曲をたくさんの方に聴いていただけて本当にありがたく思います"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そう思う度にI see...をどんどん好きになります笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46が出る番組を全部録画したりリアルタイムで観ていたあの頃の私は、歌番組に先輩方と一緒に出演させて頂くことができるなんて考えたこともなかったと思いますよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なかったよぜったいに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先輩方もI see...のイントロを一緒に踊って下さったことが嬉しかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/08/12/1839543/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとだけ質問！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・夏休みにしたい事教えてください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→花火したーい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんは花火は好きですか〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆなは見るのもするのも好きだよ( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最近何してる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最近ね簡単なお料理って言わないぐらいのお料理をしてモバメで写真を送ってる！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・洗顔フォームはチューブ？最初から泡？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→最初から泡だよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"泡つくるの下手なんだよね(･･;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・最後の高校生活何を満喫したい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・卒業までに学校でやりたいことは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→いっぱい学校に行って制服もいっぱい着たい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"高校生活を満喫したい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"終わっちゃうのやだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大人になりたくないよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう夏休みだなんて..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・一人暮らし男子が作れそうなゆなちゃんのおすすめの料理、好きな料理を教えてください！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→野菜スープ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カット野菜とお水とコンソメをいれて電子レンジでチンする！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"温まったらこしょうをかける！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かけすぎないようにね(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おーわり！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/08/12/1839543/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いイヤリング( ¨̮ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://www.nogizaka46.com/files/46/_pre/blog/yuna.shibata/img/2020/08/12/1839543/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぴーすしてみた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んでくれてありがとう！またね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（8.12 柴田柚菜）"}],"source":"official"}}